---
description: Design quality — hierarchy, restraint, no generic AI chrome
globs: DELNO-site-v23/**,delno-web/**,delno-widget/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Premium means better hierarchy, typography, spacing, and interaction — not more decorative effects.
- Avoid default purple gradients, gratuitous glass, fake metrics, and decorative Three.js.
- Prefer design tokens in `docs/design/design-system.md` over one-off magic numbers.
- Invoke `creative-director` and `visual-qa` subagents for premium UI before marking done.
